  "p_items_3": {
   "type": "array",
   "default": [
    {
     "p": "Gil Chacon executes in vivo studies at Alpha Preclinical, providing technical and surgical support, training staff and keeping the research facility running. He has been part of the founding research team since 2020."
    },
    {
     "p": "Gil has nearly 20 years of experience in preclinical contract research. Before Alpha, he was training and development coordinator at a preclinical CRO, where he made sure staff were fully trained before study assignment, supervised day-to-day study performance, managed assigned programs and maintained the research facility. Over those years he helped build that company's facility operations and study execution, and became proficient in nearly every aspect of in vivo contract research."
    },
    {
     "p": "He is especially motivated by vaccine development research."
    }
   ]
  },
